Note that $\tilde{I}\subset I$. Let $\iota_{x} : \mathbb{R}^{d_x}\to \{0,1\}$ denote the indicator function on $I_{\mathbf x}$, let $\iota_{o} : \mathbb{R}^{d_o}\to \{0,1\}$ denote the indicator function on $I_{\mathbf o}$, let $\iota:  \mathbb{R}^{d_x+d_o}\to \{0,1\}$ denote the indicator function on $I$, which satisfies $\iota = \iota_{x} \cdot \iota_{o}$. 
