\end{align*}
where we note that the relevant Fourier transforms exist since $f\in \mathcal{H}_{\gamma_x,\gamma_o}\subset L^2(\mathbb{R}^{d_x+d_o})$.

Next, we bound $(\ast) =\|f\ast \mathcal{F}^{-1}(\iota) - f\|_{L^2([0,1]^{d_x+d_o})}$. We have
\begin{align*}
