Next, we proceed to prove the second claim by plugging in the specific values of $\delta_x,\delta_o$ and $\gamma_x,\gamma_o$. 
Recall that $\frac{1}{8} \delta_x = 2s_x + d_x\eta_1 + d_x \eta_0 + d_x$, we obtain 
\begin{align*}
