We plug in $\gamma_x = n^{-\frac{\frac{1}{d_x}}{1+(2+\frac{d_o}{s_o})(\frac{s_x}{d_x}+\eta_1)}}$, $\gamma_o = n^{-\frac{\frac{1}{s_o}(\frac{s_x}{d_x}+\eta_1)}{1+(2+\frac{d_o}{s_o})(\frac{s_x}{d_x}+\eta_1)}}$ to obtain
\begin{align*}
